		(property "Function" "Isolates U4B's VENV_BUF output from the U1001 pin 5 sampling kick and forms the RF low-pass with C1005 (100R x 2.2 nF, 0.72 MHz). 100R (S-26) keeps the AINB- overload current <= 5 mA now that the AD7380 internal 2.5 V reference sets the VREF + 0.3 V input limit (AD7380 Rev A Table 5). Place north of C1005 and feed pad 1 from U501 pin 7 on F.Cu between C504 and R505."
