					(thickness 0.15)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Function" "I2C buffer: A side = host I2C1 (VCCA +3V3_D, no static offset), B side = EXP_I2C (VCCB +3V3_EXP). EN tied directly to VCCB (+3V3_EXP; EN VIH 0.7 x VCCB to 5.5 V, TI SCPS245E 5.3), so the buffer is enabled only with the shield rail; the power-up circuit keeps the outputs off until VCCB > 2.5 V and VCCA > 0.8 V (SCPS245E sec. 9). Firmware: change EXP_3V3_EN only with I2C1 idle (SCPS245E 5.6 note 1), wait >= 5 ms after enabling, then 9-clock bus recovery if SDA/SCL is held low. B.Cu beside J1201 west end; EN and VCCB via-in-pad joined on In3 (S-20)."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "783e81e3-ea7a-40ef-bd2a-d25bfe80599d")
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1 1)
					(thickness 0.15)
				)
