		(property "Function" "Converts EREF-VENV (ADC B, pins 6/5) and GND-EREF (ADC A, pins 8/7) simultaneously and streams both with CRC-8 to U401 SPI4. Internal 2.5 V reference (REFSEL = 0, S-26): wait >= 11 ms after power-up (Table 4), no PMODE shutdown or hard reset during a run. SDI carries a constant NOP stream (R105 deleted, S-4). An AD7386 fitted here uses CH=1 (pin 7 EREF, pin 5 VENV). Place on F.Cu between U502/U501 and U401 with the inputs facing the op-amps and the SPI pins facing U401. Tie pin 8, pin 10 and pin 1 to the exposed pad and put a GND via at the pad centre."
			(at 0 0 135)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "043529df-3271-4ea9-89a6-212e802d7421")
