		(property "Function" "Clamps +3V0_REF to about 0.3 V above +3V3_A when the buck collapses before +5V_A, protecting U401 VREF+ (U1001 runs on its internal reference since S-26). Place south of U503 with the anode fed from the U503 VOUT via on B.Cu and the cathode on C415 pad 1, at least 3 mm from L1301/SW copper."
