		(property "Function" "M2x0.4 x 5.0 mm SMT standoff for the shield, on B.Cu at (x 87.0, y 31.0) (asymmetric keying vs H1201 so a reversed shield cannot be screwed down), pad to GND; datasheet land is a 3.73 +0.08 mm hole and 6.2 mm pad (not a 1.6 mm pilot); add a 0.15 mm PEEK/polyimide shim so the 5.15 mm Samtec stack never bottoms J1201; M2x4 PEEK/Ti screws, 1.5 kgf.cm max. Layout (2026-09-29 pass): H1202 at (224.4, 119.8) PCB coordinates, supersedes the x 87.0 / y 31.0 note above."
