		(property "Function" "Holds BOOT0 low for the normal boot selection (user flash). B side under U401 pin 94, joined by the pin-94 via-in-pad, so BOOT0 has no floating branch (S-16: SW4/old-R801 removed; no B test pad allowed in the K9 battery window). Bench recovery: strap pad 1 (BOOT0) to +3V3_D, about 0.33 mA into this 10k, while pressing RESET to start the ROM bootloader; normal DFU entry is the firmware boot stub."
			(at 0 0 270)
			(layer "B.Fab")
