		(property "Function" "47R series termination for the U401 south-row FMC pins (P1-20): R706 pins 1/8 WR_N (U401.86 PD5 to J801.12), R702 pins 2/7 D3 (U401.82 PD1 to J801.25), R506 pins 3/6 CS_N (U401.88 PD7 to J801.10), R501 pins 4/5 D2 (U401.81 PD0 to J801.24). UNI-ROYAL 4D02 equivalent circuit: element k joins pins k and 9-k. D/C has its own R804."
